.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.backup
*.tfstate.lock.info
# Terraform state contains real secret values in plaintext (every
# kubernetes_secret_v1's own data) -- never committed. This is where
# ad hoc pre-migration backups get copied to (see the 2026-09-03
# bootstrap/app root split), not just the standard *.tfstate* names
# above.
.state-backups/
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
